                                                "sense_id": "1772e170-60bb-3faf-9cbe-60a62ee3d097",
                                                "text": "Seated on the carpet, by the side of this basin, was seen Mr. Rochester, costumed in shawls, with a turban on his head. His dark eyes and swarthy skin and Paynim features suited the costume exactly. He looked the very model of an Eastern emir, an agent or a victim of the bowstring."
